# Normalize line endings to LF in the index and the working tree.
#
# The Prettier configuration sets `endOfLine: "lf"`. Without this file, a
# Windows checkout under `core.autocrlf=true` gets CRLF in the working tree
# while the index stays LF, so `pnpm format:check` passes in CI and fails on
# every Windows machine. That reads as a broken developer setup rather than a
# missing file, so it tends to get silenced instead of fixed.
#
# `text=auto` still lets Git detect binary files and leave them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
